      "time": 1793030885.8392234,
      "body": "Done. Cell `55cf2be3` ran and produced the plot.\n\n```r\ngrid <- tibble(temp = 30:85)\n\npreds <- fit_oring |>\n    predict(new_data = grid, type = 'prob') |>\n    bind_cols(grid)\n\nggplot(challenger, aes(x = temp, y = damage)) +\n    geom_jitter(width = 0, height = 0.05) +\n    geom_line(data = preds, aes(y = .pred_yes)) +\n    geom_vline(xintercept = 31, linetype = 'dashed')\n```\n\nCurve is near 1 at 30\u00b0F and near 0 at 85\u00b0F, with the dashed line at 31\u00b0F. No other cells changed.",
